cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this coverage export, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "GreenCalculus Open Factor Coverage"
abstract: >
  A machine-readable map of what the GreenCalculus emission-factor corpus covers:
  16,673 factors from 137 publishers, each row carrying its key, section, unit,
  gas, GHG Protocol scope, publisher, licence, and whether that licence permits
  republication — with the publisher's own stated reason recorded where it does
  not. Values are deliberately excluded, so the export is GreenCalculus metadata
  about coverage rather than any publisher's data, and is therefore publishable
  regardless of upstream terms. Generated from the live API; the licence filter
  is each publisher's own terms as recorded in the API response.
authors:
  - family-names: Say
    given-names: Jeremiah
    affiliation: "GreenCalculus"
version: "2026.188"
date-released: "2026-09-10"
url: "https://greencalculus.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/greencalculus/greencalculus-open-data"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - emission factors
  - open data
  - carbon accounting
  - GHG Protocol
  - licensing
  - data provenance
  - DEFRA
  - IPCC
  - CSRD
  - sustainability
